Preserve legacy CLI numerics with small, command-scoped function overrides.

Use the installed Scanpy, sklearn and Scrublet routines. Retain only the old
ARPACK reconstruction, column-major COO traversal and obsolete TSNE argument
handling. Restore dependency bindings after each CLI command, even on errors.
Non-ARPACK solvers use installed SciPy. Keep the SciPy copyright/license notice.

